# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value. `.env` is gitignored — the real key must NEVER
# be committed, pasted into a source file, or echoed into a log or a commit message.
#
# Used ONLY by the art-generation script (scripts/gen-art.mjs — see docs/UI-DESIGN.md §9).
# The game itself needs no keys at all: the narrator is a local model, downloaded once on
# first run, then fully offline. See docs/SHIPPING.md.
# Nothing in the test suite reads this.

GOOGLE_API_KEY=
